        ("How did Zechariah 9:9 say the King would come to Jerusalem?", ["In a chariot of gold", "Lowly, riding on an ass", "With an army", "By ship"], 1, "Zechariah pictured a just and lowly King riding upon an ass."),
        ("What did Malachi tell the people to bring into the storehouse?", ["Tithes", "Weapons", "Idols", "Letters"], 0, "Malachi 3:10 calls the people to bring all the tithes into the storehouse."),
